      "genre": "记叙文",
      "title": "Strange Happenings in My Town",
      "body": "Last week, some strange things happened in my small town. Every night, people heard strange noises outside. \"What could it be?\" everyone asked. My neighbor Victor said it might be a dog. But I didn't agree. A dog can't make such a loud noise. My mother thought it could be the wind. But the wind can't move things around. One morning, we found rubbish all over the street. It must be an animal looking for food, but which animal? Finally, a policeman found the answer. It was a group of large birds! They came at night to look for food. The mystery was solved at last.",
