      "title": "The Mystery of Stonehenge",
      "body": "Stonehenge is one of the most famous mysteries in the world. It is a circle of large stones in Britain. The stones are very old and very heavy. No one knows for sure why Stonehenge was built. Some people think it might have been a place for medical care. Others believe it could have been a temple where people honored their ancestors. Some historians say it must have been used to watch the sun and stars. The biggest mystery is how the stones were moved. They weigh thousands of kilos, and there were no trucks long ago. Stonehenge still keeps its secrets today.",
