      "genre": "记叙文",
      "title": "The UFO Night",
      "body": "One summer night, Jean saw something strange in the sky. A bright light was moving slowly above her house. \"It can't be a plane,\" she thought. \"It moves too strangely.\" The light landed in a field nearby. Jean felt uneasy. She wanted to know what it was. Could it be a UFO? Could there be aliens inside? She told her friends the next day. Some said it might be a weather balloon. Others said it must be a trick of the light. Jean was not sure. To this day, she still wonders what she really saw that night. Some mysteries may never be solved.",
